Copyright and license
---------------------
Copyright in the upstream material remains with its respective copyright
holders. The pinned upstream repository identifies OpenAI as its publisher
but supplies no individualized copyright-holder or copyright-year notice
in its README, license files, or the Progressions Lean sources. Its Apache
license appendix contains the unfilled example "Copyright [yyyy] [name of
copyright owner]"; that example is not a copyright notice for this code.
